    "en": {
      "text": "Landing 4 Weapon Hits within 3 seconds of each other grants 'Heretical Behavior' for 8 (<enhanced/> ?) seconds. Each hit only counts once every 0.4 seconds. Glaive Melees require 8 hits. Area-Denial Grenade Launchers require ? hits.\n\nHeretical Behavior grants the following benefits while active:\n• 8% Increased Damage\n• 50? Handling\n• 50? Reload Speed\n• 20% Faster Reload Animation Speed\n\nBuff can be refreshed.",
